WEBVTT

02:34.060 --> 02:35.520
<b>Where is that guy?</b>

02:35.520 --> 02:36.930
<b>He isn't standing me up, is he?</b>

02:37.260 --> 02:41.350
<b>Mo Fan, Mo Fan! Here! Over here!</b>

02:42.400 --> 02:43.520
<b><i>He goes by "Shorty."</i></b>

02:43.520 --> 02:44.980
<b><i>Doesn't seem too reliable.</i></b>

02:44.980 --> 02:47.930
<b><i>But I paid a lot to the Hunter's 
Union to hire him as a guide.</i></b>

02:47.930 --> 02:54.060
<b>MISSING PERSONNEL RESCUE
REQUESTING BACKUP</b>

02:54.950 --> 02:56.600
<b>They're all requests for rescue!</b>

02:57.800 --> 03:00.350
<b>Why didn't we go to the 
Guardian Mage for help?</b>

03:00.840 --> 03:02.970
<b>Didn't Fei Jiao, Zhang Xiaohou's 
commanding officer,</b>

03:02.970 --> 03:05.270
<b>tell you to contact him 
if you get into trouble?</b>

03:07.280 --> 03:10.000
<b>The whole area outside 
Tin City is already barren.</b>

03:10.000 --> 03:12.970
<b>They're not going to waste resources 
for someone who was killed in action.</b>

03:13.470 --> 03:16.100
<b>It's better to figure this out 
ourselves than to trouble Fei Jiao.</b>

03:19.710 --> 03:24.310
<b>Xiaohou went missing between Yangyang
and Hua, in the Weiju village area.</b>

03:25.010 --> 03:27.330
<b>We need to find some older 
hunters for guidance...</b>

03:27.330 --> 03:28.180
<b>Looking for a guide?</b>

03:28.180 --> 03:29.490
<b>Let's have a chat!</b>

03:33.060 --> 03:35.930
<b>Where are you looking? Here, here!</b>

03:40.490 --> 03:43.730
<b>You sure look... professional.</b>

03:43.730 --> 03:44.770
<b>What's your price?</b>

03:46.400 --> 03:47.180
<b>One million?</b>

03:49.890 --> 03:50.850
<b><i>Ten million?</i></b>

03:51.470 --> 03:53.120
<b>Don't be so picky!</b>

03:53.120 --> 03:54.890
<b>Ask anyone in this room.</b>

03:54.890 --> 03:57.970
<b>See if anyone's willing to 
take up your job for less...</b>

03:57.970 --> 03:58.810
<b>Deal!</b>

03:59.650 --> 04:00.720
<b><i>He agreed so quickly!</i></b>

04:00.720 --> 04:02.970
<b><i>Damn it, I should've asked for more!</i></b>

04:07.390 --> 04:09.270
<b><i>Wait for me, Xiaohou.</i></b>

04:09.270 --> 04:12.470
<b><i>No matter where you are, I </i>will<i> find you!</i></b>

04:14.200 --> 04:16.270
<b>We can't walk outside Tin City at night.</b>

04:17.230 --> 04:19.560
<b>A shame. I would've
wanted to leave earlier.</b>

04:21.150 --> 04:23.280
<b>Is this what nighttime 
looks like in Tin City?</b>

04:23.280 --> 04:25.310
<b>It's like falling straight into hell.</b>

04:25.310 --> 04:27.640
<b>All kinds of evil spirits and 
ghosts are out and about!</b>

04:34.660 --> 04:36.140
<b>Yangyang Village is over there.</b>

04:36.640 --> 04:38.600
<b>I'm afraid we won't make 
it there in just one day.</b>

04:39.010 --> 04:43.850
<b>Yes, which means that we'll have to 
endure one night in this wilderness.</b>

04:47.780 --> 04:48.560
<b>What's the matter?</b>

04:51.020 --> 04:52.290
<b>The northern winds are blowing.</b>

04:52.290 --> 04:54.430
<b>The undead have smelled
 the living within the city.</b>

04:58.360 --> 04:59.350
<b>What's that?</b>

05:38.600 --> 05:40.320
<b>Why are there so many undead?!</b>

05:40.320 --> 05:41.560
<b>What are you guys doing there?!</b>

05:41.560 --> 05:42.880
<b>Get away from the city walls!</b>

05:52.670 --> 05:56.540
<b><i>The dangers outside of Tin City 
were way worse than I thought.</i></b>

05:56.540 --> 06:00.340
<b><i>We were forced to listen to our guide 
and leave the following morning.</i></b>

06:03.280 --> 06:05.140
<b>Mo Fan, over here!</b>

06:08.480 --> 06:10.620
<b>This is my partner, Big Guy.</b>

06:17.080 --> 06:18.140
<b>They are...</b>

06:18.530 --> 06:20.600
<b>Oh, they're also my clients. 
It's a group tour.</b>

06:20.970 --> 06:23.350
<b>What?! You charged me 
ten million to put me in a group?!</b>

06:23.350 --> 06:24.750
<b>What a scam!</b>

06:24.750 --> 06:26.910
<b>That was the price for a group tour.</b>

06:26.910 --> 06:28.430
<b>Didn't I tell you?</b>

06:29.630 --> 06:31.030
<b>You can have your own 
 car if you want.</b>

06:31.030 --> 06:31.930
<b>For twenty million!</b>

06:34.240 --> 06:35.190
<b>It's fine.</b>

06:35.190 --> 06:36.420
<b>We'll each do our own thing.</b>

06:36.420 --> 06:37.470
<b>We won't bother one another.</b>

06:38.230 --> 06:39.510
<b>See, she doesn't mind!</b>

06:39.510 --> 06:41.100
<b>It's just you being cheap and demanding!</b>

06:43.210 --> 06:45.430
<b>Preparing for battle! 
Enter quickly, leave quickly!</b>

07:16.020 --> 07:16.860
<b>What do you think?</b>

07:16.860 --> 07:19.400
<b>Didn't expect to run into a beauty 
like this in a tour group, right?</b>

07:19.400 --> 07:22.970
<b>So elegant and mysterious, isn't she?</b>

07:24.230 --> 07:25.580
<b>Certainly not bad.</b>

07:29.070 --> 07:30.930
<b>It looks like she practices dark magic.</b>

07:31.380 --> 07:34.430
<b>Yes. I sensed that in her aura.</b>

07:35.120 --> 07:35.990
<b>You're right.</b>

07:35.990 --> 07:37.850
<b>A very fragrant dark aura.</b>

07:38.640 --> 07:40.020
<b>How long until we're there?</b>

07:40.690 --> 07:43.820
<b>What you should be asking
 is how long until sunset.</b>

07:47.320 --> 07:49.560
<b>Eat this before it turns dark.</b>

07:49.560 --> 07:51.320
<b>Why didn't you say you had food?</b>

07:53.020 --> 07:54.320
<b>I'm so hungry!</b>

07:57.420 --> 07:59.210
<b>What the hell is this?!
It's disgusting!</b>

08:00.220 --> 08:02.620
<b>Give it a second, and you'll love it.</b>

08:09.710 --> 08:11.520
<b>Shush! Listen.</b>

08:16.220 --> 08:17.520
<b>Beneath us! In the soil...</b>

08:23.400 --> 08:24.590
<b>Quickly! Eat the ashen garlic!</b>

08:24.590 --> 08:25.850
<b>I've told you this already,</b>

08:25.850 --> 08:28.230
<b>but I only guarantee that you won't
be surrounded by undead at night!</b>

08:28.230 --> 08:30.610
<b>If one or two of them with 
messed up noses come up to you,</b>

08:30.610 --> 08:31.770
<b>you're on your own...</b>

08:33.610 --> 08:35.850
<b>Ten million and no security?!</b>

08:38.290 --> 08:40.440
<b>Stay away from me, ugly!</b>

08:48.700 --> 08:49.970
<b>My goodness...</b>

08:53.710 --> 08:55.640
<b>Mo Fan! Look around!</b>

09:01.500 --> 09:03.160
<b>How many of them are there?!</b>

09:03.160 --> 09:04.970
<b>We didn't hit an undead nest, did we?!</b>

09:08.660 --> 09:10.000
<b>Why are they all coming at me?!</b>

09:10.000 --> 09:11.140
<b>Eat the garlic!</b>

09:14.100 --> 09:15.700
<b>Doesn't it taste great?</b>

09:19.240 --> 09:20.200
<b>This is ashen garlic.</b>

09:20.200 --> 09:21.990
<b>It's used to cover up the 
scent of living people.</b>

09:21.990 --> 09:24.400
<b>Undead won't attack 
you after you eat it.</b>

09:24.400 --> 09:26.740
<b>It's very valuable, and we 
have a limited quantity.</b>

09:26.740 --> 09:28.770
<b>If any of you spit it out,</b>

09:28.770 --> 09:30.680
<b>don't blame me if 
you don't last the night.</b>

09:37.410 --> 09:38.670
<b><i>Does it work that well?</i></b>

09:38.670 --> 09:40.280
<b>Leave this place, quickly!</b>

09:40.280 --> 09:41.860
<b>This must be the grave of 
some ancient lord</b>

09:41.860 --> 09:43.430
<b>and the burial grounds for his servants.</b>

09:43.430 --> 09:44.930
<b>The small fry aren't too bad,</b>

09:44.930 --> 09:46.980
<b>but I'm afraid the big one 
is gonna come out, too.</b>

09:46.980 --> 09:49.370
<b>If some great, undead general
shows up, we're done for!</b>

10:06.440 --> 10:08.030
<b>We're safe here for now.</b>

10:08.030 --> 10:09.730
<b>Everyone rest up here.</b>

10:15.750 --> 10:17.220
<b>Is it always like this out here?</b>

10:19.000 --> 10:20.280
<b>It wasn't as bad in previous years.</b>

10:20.280 --> 10:22.400
<b>The dead would just move 
around in certain areas.</b>

10:22.400 --> 10:24.040
<b>But they're extra aggressive this year.</b>

10:24.040 --> 10:28.190
<b>Some people said that they've seen undead
wandering around in the light of day.</b>

10:29.550 --> 10:30.470
<b>Why's that?</b>

10:30.470 --> 10:31.860
<b>No idea.</b>

10:31.860 --> 10:34.270
<b>Rumors say that the Millennium 
Sovereign is about to reawaken.</b>

10:34.270 --> 10:37.890
<b>All the undead of Tin City are 
becoming more active because of its aura.</b>

10:38.290 --> 10:40.180
<b>And what is this Millennium Sovereign?</b>

10:40.180 --> 10:41.970
<b>Didn't you study history?</b>

10:41.970 --> 10:44.850
<b>Don't you know who the most powerful 
ruler in the history of Tin City is?</b>

10:45.280 --> 10:48.410
<b>Huh? That'd be a sovereign from 
several thousand years ago.</b>

10:48.410 --> 10:49.890
<b>It's not like he can come back to life.</b>

10:49.890 --> 10:52.640
<b>Of course he's not going 
to come back to life.</b>

10:52.640 --> 10:54.640
<b>But you're seeing these undead...</b>

10:55.040 --> 10:57.700
<b>The Holy Judgment Court has sent people 
 to investigate in the past.</b>

10:57.700 --> 10:59.920
<b>They were all unparalleled mages.</b>

11:00.560 --> 11:02.440
<b>But not a single one returned alive...</b>

11:03.160 --> 11:04.310
<b>The Holy Judgment Court!</b>

11:04.880 --> 11:06.020
<b>What's that?</b>

11:06.480 --> 11:08.210
<b>They're similar to our Judgment Council,</b>

11:08.210 --> 11:10.940
<b>but they're an international 
magic judicial organization.</b>

11:10.940 --> 11:14.090
<b><i>Could this woman be from 
the Holy Judgment Court?</i></b>

11:16.490 --> 11:17.760
<b>Let's hurry it up!</b>

11:17.760 --> 11:19.980
<b>We need to make it to Yangyang 
Village in one go now!</b>

11:26.330 --> 11:27.360
<b>You guys wait here.</b>

11:27.360 --> 11:29.200
<b>I'm going to alert the village first.</b>

11:29.200 --> 11:31.890
<b>There are rules in the village
 that you'll have to follow.</b>

11:34.330 --> 11:35.850
<b>That ashen garlic worked like a charm.</b>

11:35.850 --> 11:38.680
<b>Undead didn't detect 
us at all on our way here.</b>

11:39.110 --> 11:40.700
<b>With something that good,</b>

11:40.700 --> 11:42.370
<b>undead don't seem
that scary anymore.</b>

11:42.370 --> 11:45.740
<b>Brother, that ashen garlic 
is rarer than gold.</b>

11:45.740 --> 11:47.200
<b>It also can't be cultivated.</b>

11:47.200 --> 11:50.010
<b>Only the people living in the Weiju 
area know how to harvest them.</b>

11:50.940 --> 11:55.000
<b>It's a good thing Big Guy has 
Weiju blood in him...</b>

11:55.000 --> 11:56.600
<b>What's the matter?!</b>

11:59.910 --> 12:01.500
<b>What's happening? What's happening?!</b>

12:07.400 --> 12:08.540
<b>Are you screwing with us?!</b>

12:08.540 --> 12:11.390
<b>I- I don't know what's going on, either!</b>

12:14.240 --> 12:16.480
<b>Auntie Liu! Uncle!</b>

12:16.480 --> 12:18.870
<b>Little Sis! Little Bro!</b>

12:18.870 --> 12:19.620
<b>Where are you?!</b>

12:19.620 --> 12:22.320
<b>Brother! Calm down!</b>

12:22.320 --> 12:24.330
<b>It doesn't look to be the 
work of undead.</b>

12:24.330 --> 12:26.060
<b>It looks like someone
did this on purpose...</b>

12:38.830 --> 12:40.080
<b>Ashen plums...</b>

12:41.040 --> 12:41.930
<b>Over here, too!</b>

12:47.850 --> 12:49.780
<b>I don't know what happened here,</b>

12:49.780 --> 12:51.330
<b>but I don't see any bodies.</b>

12:52.550 --> 12:54.150
<b>It doesn't matter,</b>

12:54.150 --> 12:55.720
<b>we're not going to see any bodies.</b>

12:56.600 --> 12:57.750
<b>Let's go, let's go.</b>

12:57.750 --> 12:59.510
<b>You guys don't see anything.</b>

12:59.510 --> 13:01.800
<b>Maybe they've just moved.</b>

13:01.800 --> 13:03.060
<b>Don't be so pessimistic...</b>

13:03.430 --> 13:05.290
<b>Let's go straight to the next village.</b>

13:05.290 --> 13:06.560
<b>There's no point in staying here.</b>

13:06.920 --> 13:09.120
<b>Yes, exactly! Let's go straight to Hua Village!</b>

13:09.120 --> 13:12.020
<b>Maybe they will know something 
about the situation at Yangyang Village!</b>

13:26.950 --> 13:29.810
<b>It'll take two days to get to Hua Village.</b>

13:29.810 --> 13:32.350
<b>I originally calculated that we 
could save some ashen garlic</b>

13:32.350 --> 13:34.070
<b>by staying at Yangyang 
Village for half the night.</b>

13:34.070 --> 13:37.020
<b>It looks like we're going 
to run out halfway now.</b>

13:37.790 --> 13:39.600
<b>Should we turn back?</b>

13:39.990 --> 13:42.040
<b>We've just discussed this.</b>

13:42.040 --> 13:43.060
<b>On our way here,</b>

13:43.060 --> 13:45.660
<b>I discovered that not all of the areas 
were covered with undead.</b>

13:45.660 --> 13:48.100
<b>We can save the garlic for 
now and not use them.</b>

13:48.550 --> 13:51.760
<b>We'll eat them when we encounter 
too many undead to handle.</b>

13:51.760 --> 13:54.310
<b>One or two undead 
shouldn't be a problem.</b>

13:54.310 --> 13:55.560
<b>That's a good idea!</b>

13:56.160 --> 13:58.670
<b>Agreed! The customer is always right!</b>

13:59.200 --> 14:02.810
<b>Everyone always thinks 
they're all-powerful...</b>

14:15.560 --> 14:16.560
<b>Ice Shackles!</b>

14:21.330 --> 14:22.320
<b>Bone Crusher!</b>

14:23.220 --> 14:25.890
<b>Oh my, this guy's got some skills!</b>

14:26.500 --> 14:28.140
<b>Li, don't waste your mana.</b>

14:30.180 --> 14:33.420
<b>Come to think of it, Miss 
Black Lace—oh, pardon me.</b>

14:33.420 --> 14:34.830
<b>We've been traveling together,</b>

14:34.830 --> 14:36.520
<b>but I never asked for your names!</b>

14:36.880 --> 14:39.850
<b>Ye Meng'e. You can call me Meng'e.</b>

14:39.850 --> 14:40.900
<b>This is Li.</b>

14:40.900 --> 14:41.680
<b>This is Xin.</b>

14:42.160 --> 14:44.650
<b>Did you choose that
local name temporarily?</b>

14:44.650 --> 14:46.310
<b>Is there something strange with my name?</b>

14:47.300 --> 14:49.100
<b>It's rare for us to
choose names like that.</b>

14:49.100 --> 14:50.910
<b>I think Cuihua would be 
a better name for you,</b>

14:50.910 --> 14:52.150
<b>added to your original surname.</b>

14:52.150 --> 14:54.470
<b>For example, Elizabeth Cuihua.</b>

14:54.470 --> 14:55.630
<b>Such a regal name!</b>

14:55.630 --> 14:57.300
<b>It shows how worldly you are.</b>

14:58.290 --> 14:59.220
<b>Is that so?</b>

15:03.250 --> 15:04.970
<b>Don't listen to his nonsense, miss.</b>

15:04.970 --> 15:07.200
<b>Your name sounds great.</b>

15:09.140 --> 15:11.080
<b>The sun will rise in about an hour.</b>

15:11.080 --> 15:13.230
<b>Undead are probably 
going home to sleep soon.</b>

15:14.110 --> 15:16.440
<b>I was thinking the undead
of Tin City would be so strong.</b>

15:16.440 --> 15:18.430
<b>Seems like they're just 
a bunch of dumbasses.</b>

15:18.430 --> 15:20.790
<b>Don't say that, Brother!</b>

15:20.790 --> 15:22.090
<b>This place is cursed!</b>

15:22.090 --> 15:23.640
<b>You really shouldn't say things like that!</b>

15:33.010 --> 15:36.140
<b>No way! Why's it raining all of a sudden?</b>

15:47.250 --> 15:50.350
<b>Run! The rain will wash off the 
scent of the ashen garlic!</b>

15:53.110 --> 15:55.560
<b>Damn it! There's more and more blood here!</b>

15:55.560 --> 15:57.180
<b>I'm afraid there might be a big one!</b>

16:12.480 --> 16:15.110
<b>Holy shit! It's a big Corpse General!</b>

16:16.650 --> 16:18.320
<b>You and your cursed mouth!</b>

16:18.320 --> 16:20.080
<b>If you're so strong, <i>you</i> deal with this!</b>

16:20.080 --> 16:24.180
<b>Why... Why have you abandoned me?!</b>

16:26.800 --> 16:27.680
<b>Who are you?!</b>

16:27.680 --> 16:29.310
<b>Go look for whoever abandoned you, then!</b>

16:29.310 --> 16:30.930
<b>It's you! All of you!</b>

16:30.930 --> 16:34.140
<b>You all abandoned me!</b>

16:36.040 --> 16:38.430
<b>Xin! Li! Take care of the rotting corpses!</b>

16:54.640 --> 16:55.890
<b>We'll fight this together!</b>

16:55.890 --> 16:59.030
<b>Run! You guys, run!</b>

16:59.030 --> 17:01.390
<b>We're no match for the Corpse General!</b>

17:01.390 --> 17:04.310
<b>He's going to summon all the undead
within a one-kilometer radius!</b>

17:04.310 --> 17:06.320
<b>This place is already 
crawling with undead.</b>

17:06.320 --> 17:10.020
<b>Panicking and scattering blindly 
will only get us killed one by one.</b>

17:10.430 --> 17:13.560
<b>That's right. Getting rid of this 
Corpse General is the best play.</b>

17:17.440 --> 17:20.090
<b>If we can't defeat it, then we'll 
just have to last until sunrise!</b>

17:20.090 --> 17:22.520
<b>Li Ru! Go pull those undead away!</b>

17:29.080 --> 17:31.500
<b>Can she... handle it?</b>

17:32.570 --> 17:34.680
<b>Don't worry! She's stronger
than you think!</b>

17:36.670 --> 17:39.760
<b>Be with me! All of you, be with me!</b>

17:42.970 --> 17:43.880
<b>Shield Shadow!</b>

17:49.810 --> 17:51.120
<b>I'll grab its attention!</b>

17:51.120 --> 17:53.100
<b>Try to control it with Shadow Nails!</b>

17:58.000 --> 17:59.930
<b>Lightning Seal!</b>

18:07.440 --> 18:08.670
<b>Blood Beast Boots!</b>

18:22.180 --> 18:24.300
<b>My goodness, that's way too fast!</b>

18:32.950 --> 18:35.850
<b><i>This Corpse General is even 
stronger than a Terror Demon!</i></b>

18:35.850 --> 18:38.140
<b><i>A team of mid-tier mages would 
be nothing against him!</i></b>

18:40.090 --> 18:42.120
<b><i>And he's got such good eyesight!</i></b>

18:46.890 --> 18:48.100
<b>Large Shadow Nail!</b>

19:12.310 --> 19:14.430
<b>Thunderbolt, Wild Dance!</b>

20:51.890 --> 21:24.170
<b>PREVIEW</b>

20:52.140 --> 20:54.310
<b>Thunderbolt, Wild Dance!</b>

20:56.770 --> 20:58.350
<b>It's still not dead?</b>

20:58.350 --> 21:00.100
<b>There's more and more undead!</b>

21:00.100 --> 21:01.390
<b>We can't hold them off!</b>

21:02.890 --> 21:06.450
<b><i>No. There's not enough time to draw 
a mid-tier magic constellation.</i></b>

21:06.450 --> 21:08.480
<b>Still no news from the oracle?</b>

21:09.430 --> 21:10.060
<b>Not yet.</b>

21:11.110 --> 21:13.930
<b>Old Yang that was guarding the village 
was devoured by undead!</b>

21:15.430 --> 21:16.930
<b>Undead are coming!</b>
